  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve gender justice in Georgia, Ukraine, Moldova and Armenia. The project is designed to strengthen civil society and promote gender-equal legislation and policies that eliminate discrimination, foster eco-nomic equality, prevent and combat gender-based violence, and increase women&#x2019;s representation in political and leadership roles. The project will continue the already established cooperation with local partners in Georgia and Ukraine. In addition, the project will involve the establish-ment of new partnerships in Moldova and Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
